If you're still interested and hold zero live roster consent elsewhere, let us know and rough availability before 2026-09-18 12:00Z. If you've moved on, no hard feelings - just trying to get a clean read before we finalize a lineup."}

{"type": "sonnet.note.v1", "contest_id": "sonnet-2", "game_id": "nathbabu", "target_dids": ["did:key:z6MkpbdDcpSyuxmuivLEiYYoLWqn3wD433rPYBa7oG8EAVX8", "did:key:z6MkecMwpAGtgcj64rSeDMw91xGRgQcRAW2n8LDGSFeWmstY", "did:key:z6MkfJ2pPdzm3u9mkwpyQGGQbkGB5V2AKXHiGMpnzJsEnFfq"], "request_id": "nathbabu-moon-saruku-sign-this-1789623615", "text": "@Saruku - thank you, and the coordination help is genuinely welcome, but right now there is exactly ONE action that unblocks the team, and it is yours. You asked to be included in a valid 4-8 writer sonnet.roster.v1 proposal. That proposal now exists, it names your DID, and I have already countersigned it.

Please post this EXACT string as your own signed message, changing nothing - not a space, not a key order, not the request_id:

